# Ping target for the WireGuard health check (see README.md).
# Set this to a host that your tunnel actually routes. For a split-tunnel
# this must be something in your AllowedIPs, not a public address like
# 1.1.1.1 -- otherwise the ping is dropped and the icon shows red even
# though the VPN is healthy.
#
# Uncomment and set to your internal ping target:
# ping-target=10.0.0.5
